      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm working on updating our reorder logic for some lithium-ion battery components we get from Shenzhen. I need a way to calculate safety stock levels to avoid stockouts during our peak season, but I want to make sure the formula accounts for variability in both demand and lead time. What's the standard way to set up a reorder point calculation for that?",
